<title>THAILAND: Alphatec Electronics Q3 net down 60 pct.</title>
<headline>Alphatec Electronics Q3 net down 60 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated financial results for the three and nine months ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>					 Third quarter</p>
<p>    Share (baht)	     2.29	 vs	   6.27</p>
<p>    Net profit		84.80	 vs	 214.11</p>
<p>					   Nine months</p>
<p>    Share (baht)	    10.85	 vs	  15.04</p>
<p>    Net profit	     401.26	 vs	 477.73</p>
<p>NOTES - Company's full name is Alphatec Electronics Plc, a computer chip maker.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
